#proof(title: "Proof")[
Define $phi.alt\(x\)= inf_(t in I) { Pr_I r\(x\,t\)eq.not 0 }$, then there is a retraction $X times I arrow.r^(r') X times { 0 } union overline(A) times I$ #display-equation($r'\(x\,t\)= cases((Pr_X r \( x \, t \) \, 0) quad t lt.eq phi.alt\(x\), (Pr_X r \( x \, phi.alt \( x \) \) \, t - phi.alt \( x \)) quad t gt.eq phi.alt\(x\))$)

