#statement("Definition")[
$E_1 arrow.r^(p_1) B_1$, $E_2 arrow.r^(p_2) B_2$ are fibrations, $p_1 arrow.r^(f_0\,f_1) p_2$ are #strong[fiber homotopic]#index-entry("Fiber homotopy") if there exists $p_1 arrow.r^(f_t) P_2$ varying from $f_0$ to $f_1$. $p_1\,p_2$ are #strong[fiber homotopy equivalent]#index-entry("Fiber homotopy equivalence") if there are fiber homotopies $p_0 arrow.r^f p_1$ and $p_1 arrow.r^g p_0$ such that $f g$, $g f$ fiber homotopic to $1$

